# Synthetic: 3CEB.cif without its _entity category, like a refinement
# program's output. MSE and LLP have a label_seq_id, so they could be chain
# residues and are flagged; sulfate and glycerol outside the chain are sorted
# by the lists. LLP still adds PLP through _pdbx_struct_mod_residue, which does
# not count as chain membership here (unlike MODRES in a PDB-format file).
# 
_entry.id   3CEB 
